; Island terrain. Top of every walkable slab is exactly y = 0.
;
; The grass is FOUR slabs rather than one, because the crypt stairwell needs a
; genuine hole in the ground at x 6..12, z -4..6. A single ground box would
; have to be cut, and there is no boolean subtraction here -- so the hole is
; made by leaving a gap between slabs.
;
;   x -60..60  z -60..-4   G1
;   x -60..6   z  -4..6    G2      <- gap between G2 and G3 is the stairwell
;   x  12..60  z  -4..6    G3
;   x -60..60  z   6..30   G4
;   x -60..60  z  30..46   Beach
;
; Seabed sits at y = -6, below the crypt floor (-5.5), so running off the
; island drops you into the shallows instead of falling forever.
